    "dialogue:ep89-map-intro-1:en": {
      "text": "Wukong gasped as his companions began to look ill.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/fdb45165d552.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n001"
    },
    "dialogue:ep89-map-intro-1:zh": {
      "text": "悟空倒吸一口气,只见他的同伴们脸色开始变得苍白。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/dcbd18dee8bb.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n001"
    },
    "dialogue:ep89-map-intro-2:en": {
      "text": "The Tang Monk's head bobbed forward, and his teacup dropped from his hand.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/d0e01ee0ad14.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n002"
    },
    "dialogue:ep89-map-intro-2:zh": {
      "text": "唐僧的头微微前倾,手中的茶杯随之掉落。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/46ff5b58a0d5.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n002"
    },
    "dialogue:ep89-map-quiz-1:en": {
      "text": "\"What will I do? I have no way to save my friends. That priest's light is too powerful.\"",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/561cb98610b7.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n036"
    },
    "dialogue:ep89-map-quiz-1:zh": {
      "text": "\"我该怎么办?我无计可施,无法救出我的朋友们。那位神父的法术太强大了。\"",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/dde3980cfc40.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n036"
